{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "云", "id": "云"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "條", "id": "條"}, {"form": "獵", "id": "獵"}, {"form": "理", "id": "理"}, {"form": "男", "id": "男"}, {"form": "終", "id": "終"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "聲", "id": "聲"}, {"form": "較", "id": "較"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.173878458937465, "source": "智", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 4.09016919081162, "source": "智", "target": "條"}, {"weight": 4.09016919081162, "source": "智", "target": "理"}, {"weight": 4.09016919081162, "source": "較", "target": "獵"}, {"weight": 1.7875840978175743, "source": "較", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.7875840978175743, "source": "較", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.99155690214351, "source": "子", "target": "男"}, {"weight": 1.38211898970941, "source": "子", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.1997974329154555, "source": "子", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.5644405465033646, "source": "云", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.969905654611529, "source": "道", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.7875840978175743, "source": "道", "target": "獵"}, {"weight": 4.09016919081162, "source": "條", "target": "理"}, {"weight": 3.397022010251675, "source": "條", "target": "聲"}, {"weight": 4.09016919081162, "source": "條", "target": "終"}, {"weight": 2.4807312783775197, "source": "條", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.99155690214351, "source": "條", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 1.7875840978175743, "source": "獵", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.397022010251675, "source": "聲", "target": "理"}, {"weight": 1.787584097817